  "expectedNames": [
    "shared options preserve keyboard focus and do not confirm on selection",
    "shared slider and labelled equipment textarea retain focused controls across edits",
    "invalid, busy and saved states disable confirmation and move completed focus to the heading",
    "uncertain state offers the same-command retry; unavailable keeps saved receipt without a no-match claim",
    "comparison uses the supplied offer projector, shared cards/table and exact units/unknown/source evidence",
    "absent or failed canonical offer projection never paints an unverified ready page",
    "body teardown suppresses a late read; aborted mount performs no work",
    "standard element retains a pre-upgrade adapter and disconnect cleans its pending body",
    "owned block sources have no inline handlers, unsafe execution or stylesheet changes inside kit controls"
  ],
